industries prioritize their social media presence, allowing them to reach their <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a> via a platform they frequent.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>A marketer specializing in social media typically works freelance or as part of a more extensive marketing department to develop an effective social media strategy. They are responsible for running an organization&#8217;s social media accounts, attracting new customers, and retaining existing ones to increase company sales constantly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are Social Media Marketer Skills?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"976\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills-976x1024.webp\" alt=\"Social Media Marketer Skills\" class=\"wp-image-8119\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills-976x1024.webp 976w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills-286x300.webp 286w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills-768x806.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills-150x157.webp 150w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/social-media-marketer-skills.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 976px) 100vw, 976px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Social media marketing can be an exotic fit for you if you enjoy a challenge. So today, we will talk about the 12 social media marketing skills needed for social media marketers so that you are prepared for success.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist